{title: Tumhari Nazar Kyon Khafa Ho Gayi}
{artist: Ravi Mohammed Rafi Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m] [C#],        Tumhari nazar kyon khafa ho gayi
[E] [D] [F#m],        Khata bakhsh do gar khata ho gayee
[F#m] [C#],        Hamara irada toh kuchh bhee naa tha
[E] [D] [F#m],        Tumharee khata khud saja ho gayee
[F#m],        Saja hee sahee aaj kuchh toh mila hai
[B] [A] [F#m],        Saja me bhee ik pyar kaa silsila hai
[F#m] [C#],        Mohabbat kaa kuchh bhee anjam ho,
[E] [D] [F#m],        mulakat hee iltaja ho gayee
[F#m],        Mulakat peh itane magarur kyon ho
[B] [A] [F#m],        Hamaree khushamad peh majabur kyon ho
[F#m] [C#],        Manane kee adat kahan pa gayee
[E] [D] [F#m],        Khatao kee talim kya ho gayee
[F#m],        Satate naa ham toh manate hee kaise
[B] [A] [F#m],        Tumhe apne najdik late hee kaise
[F#m] [C#],        Isee din kaa chahat ko arman tha
[E] [D] [F#m],        kubul aaj dil kee dua ho gayee
